  <a href="support.html">Help</a>
</div>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge">
    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"/></svg>
    Developer Platform
  </div>
  <h1>CommerceForge <span>Dev Docs</span></h1>
  <p>Learn how to build an app, or customize your storefront. Whether you're just getting started, deep in the development process, or ready to distribute and monetize your work, CommerceForge's docs, dev tools and frameworks make building easy and efficient.</p>
  <div class="hero-ctas">
    <a href="apps-build.html" class="btn-primary">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
      Build your first app
    </a>
    <a href="storefronts.html" class="btn-secondary">Build a storefront</a>
    <a href="agents.html" class="btn-secondary">Build agents with UCP</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Product Cards -->
<section class="section">
  <h2 class="section-title">Build anything on CommerceForge</h2>
  <p class="section-subtitle">Three paths to extend, customize, and innovate on the platform.</p>
  <div class="product-cards">
    <a href="apps-build.html" class="product-card" style="text-decoration:none">
      <div class="product-card-icon apps">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Apps</h3>
      <p>Extend CommerceForge's core functionality with apps that integrate into the admin, online store, checkout and more.</p>
      <span>Build your first app</span>
    </a>
    <a href="storefronts.html" class="product-card" style="text-decoration:none">
      <div class="product-card-icon storefronts">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
      </div>
